# Intent: Fix: opening Apps (or Games or Settings) from the quick sheet while the games swipe page was open drew both screens over each other. The sheet closed back to the page it covered and the Apps wall then opened on top of it. Now one rule covers everything on the glass (maipai_screens_core.h): a sheet may sit over the face or a swipe page, every other surface is exclusive, and opening any surface closes what may not stay. The sheet and the swipe pages ask the screen manager like the other screens, and the three sheet tiles that open a screen go straight to it.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/maipai_screens_core.h, maipai_screens.h, maipai_pages.cc, maipai_pages.h (ours)
# Check after a flash: open the games page (swipe from the face), swipe up for the sheet, tap Apps: only the Apps wall is on the glass (snapshot), and the same for Games and the gear; back on the face the sheet and the page are gone (self.pages.status).
# Kconfig: none

